    "body": "OK! Please come back when you have a real spec ready to submit as a PR. Until that time it's not appropriate to use the WHATWG repositories for developing your drafts.\r\n\r\n(You can see this model used in many other cases, listed in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#ipr .)",
